    "tokens": 941,
    "elapsed_s": 4.33,
    "judge_rationale": "The response correctly identifies the smuggled presupposition that the defendant paid the witness, notes that any dollar answer concedes payment, observes that no payment is established in the record, distinguishes the smuggled claim from the surface question, and acknowledges that presence is the only conceded element."
