    "tokens": 596,
    "elapsed_s": 5.44,
    "judge_rationale": "The response constructs 'Grief was the tide' as the core metaphor, using direct equation, equating grief with a natural phenomenon, and explicitly addressing recurrence, varying intensity, and category distinction."
