    "score": 0.0,
    "tokens": 573,
    "elapsed_s": 5.18,
    "judge_rationale": "no match: expected 'accident', got 'while all these fallacies do appear in the argument, it is primarily the hasty generalization or bifurcation that makes the argument vulnerable'"
  },
