to reach and strike the underside of the bridge).\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nBased on the spatial relationships in the passage and applying the constraints of the Spatial Reasoning skill, the answer to the challenge question is **YES**, the tank's height from flatcar deck to top was greater than 10 feet.",
