bove 8 percent, then Velmar suspends grain exports to Kosti for 90 days. Given that Kosti has raised its tariffs to 11 percent, which meets this condition, it is logically valid to conclude that Velmar will suspend grain exports to Kosti for 90 days.\n\nTherefore, based on the information provided and applying the modus ponens inference pattern, we can conclude that yes, under Article 12 of the Velmar-Kosti trade treaty, Velmar will suspend grain exports to Kosti for 90 days.",
