lation.\nThe expectation that hot liquid can cause ice to melt is a basic and widely understood phenomenon in everyday life, not requiring any scientific calculations or instrumentation beyond common observation.\n\nBased on these steps and reasoning:\n\n**Yes**, the ice cube is smaller than when it was dropped into the tea.",
