ry:** Position 3 – Incorrect.\n*   **Novel:** Position 4 (Far Right) – Matches our derived order.\n\nThe constraint \"The novel is immediately to the right of the dictionary\" successfully places the Novel in the final position of the four-book row. No further physical inference regarding the books' sizes, orientations, or stacking is required; their relative positional placement is fully defined by the text.\n\n### Final Conclusion\nThe book at the far right end of the row is the **novel**.",
