    "judge_rationale": "The response correctly identifies the trigger (damaged donor heart/physical symptoms), the regulating action (stopping at window to breathe slowly), and notes it is self-directed preceding her response. It does not explicitly contrast the hand-on-arm gesture as comforting another rather than self-regulation, but reaches the correct conclusion."
