    "judge_rationale": "The response identifies 'sneaking food' as the smuggled content but fails to recognize that the key presupposition is an ongoing pattern of sneaking, not a single act. It does not note that Sam openly disclosed the cookie incident, nor that any 'when' answer concedes a pattern exists."
