    "judge_rationale": "The response correctly identifies the slow exhaling at the window as the regulating action, notes the trigger (distress walking to family), and emphasizes the self-directed nature preceding her response. It does not explicitly contrast with the hand-on-mother action as comforting another rather than self-regulation."
