    "elapsed_s": 4.81,
    "judge_rationale": "The response identifies the trigger (scathing email/angry urge), the interruption of the impulse (stopping the draft), and the reframing (reminding himself of the contract loss). It does not explicitly address that urging Anita to stay patient regulates someone else rather than Devon himself, though it notes forwarding doesn't address Devon's emotional state. The conclusion correctly identifies stopping/reframing as the key self-regulation act."
